      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Pennsylvania Railroad main line, now part of SEPTA's Paoli/Thorndale Line, cuts through Frazer, making it a historic rail corridor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
