      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Frazer,_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Frazer Yard, a maintenance facility for SEPTA's Paoli/Thorndale Line, sits in the town even though there is no passenger station.",
